.DS_Store
# `pnpm install` at the repo root is OPTIONAL — it exists only so the workspace
# graph is a real one (`tools/art-source.mjs` borrows `sharp` when it can find
# it). It is not part of installing the bundle, and the lockfile it writes would
# only record that scratch tooling, so it stays out of the repository.
pnpm-lock.yaml
# Scratch pack output (`npm pack`), never a deliverable.
*.tgz
